  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DarkFantasy.LoreNpc
  speaker: An inscription
  pages:
  - HERE THE SILVERSMITHS OF CAER VAELMOOR HID THE LAST LIGHT OF THE OLD SUN.
  - 'Three arms were forged from it, that no mirror might hold them: a blade that
    wakes the dawn, a bow strung with starlight, a citole that sings the seraphs''
    hymn.'
  - The light does not stay. Some nights the vault is empty; some nights it waits.
    Whoever finds it carries it out for all who walk beside them.
  promptVerb: Read
  interactDistance: 2.6
  flourish: 3
  lookRoot: {fileID: 0}
